.TH NAVI-THEME 1 2026-11-27 Navi "Navi Manual"
.nh
.SH NAME
navi-theme \- change Navi's colors
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B navi-theme
.RI [ name ]
.br
.B navi-theme
.RB [ \-m | \-r ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Switches Navi's color theme without logging out.
The theme stays after you log out.
Run
.B navi-theme
by itself to list the themes; the current one is marked with
.BR * .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.I name
Switch to that theme.
.TP
.BR \-m ", " \-\-menu
Pick a theme from a menu.
.TP
.BR \-r ", " \-\-reapply
Apply the current theme again.
.TP
.BR \-\-login ", " \-\-filter
Used by Navi itself.
.SH THEMES
navi (default), midnight, mono, moss, ember, crimson, grove, phosphor, nebula.
.SH YOUR OWN THEMES
Copy a theme from
.I ~/.local/share/navi/themes/
to
.I ~/.config/navi/themes/
with a new name and change its colors.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/navi/themes/
Navi's themes.
.TP
.I ~/.config/navi/themes/
Your themes.
.TP
.I ~/.config/navi/theme/
The current theme.
